<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Runyip creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Runyip` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. Its own
  `<race><body>` points at `QuadrupedAnimalWithHoovesAndHorn`, confirmed
  VANILLA CORE (Data/Core/Defs/Bodies/Bodies_Animal_Quadruped.xml) — left
  bare, no BodyDef ported. `leatherDef` (`Leather_Plain`) is vanilla Core,
  left bare; `specificMeatDef` (`Pachydermoid_Meat`) ALREADY EXISTS as
  `RSW_Pachydermoid_Meat` (Pass 12, Mudhorn) — no new resource needed. Its
  Odyssey specialTrainable (`SW_Spur`) repoints to the ALREADY-PORTED
  `RSW_SW_Spur` (RSW_MlieWaveB_Abilities.xml, ported alongside Kybuck, Pass
  16) — no new ability needed. Adult lifeStage sounds (`Pawn_Runyip_*`) were
  already absorbed in the 2026-09-02 sound wave — confirmed present in
  SoundDefs_SWBestiary.xml as `RSW_Pawn_Runyip_*`, wired, not re-done. No
  `canCrossBreedWith` (donor sets none, and no already-ported species lists
  bare `Runyip` either).

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for Runyip (checked first). 14 PNGs extracted
  this pass via extract_bundle.py against the same AssetBundle every prior
  wave used: `Runyip_{south,east,north}` (adult/juvenile shared base facing),
  `Runyip_Swimming_{south,east,north}` (a `waterSeeker`/`waterCellCost`
  species with a per-life-stage `swimmingGraphicData`, same pattern
  Mott/Pikobis established), `Runyip_Dessicated`, and the baby stage's own
  distinct `Runyip_j_{south,east,north}` / `Runyip_j_Swimming_{south,east,
  north}` / `Runyip_j_Dessicated`. The donor's own unreferenced
  `RunyipPack_{south,east,north}` and `Runyip_jPack_{south,east,north}`
  saddle-variant textures (6 PNGs) were excluded — unreferenced by the def,
  same "unreferenced-by-the-def" precedent as every prior wave's "Pack"
  exclusions. Sits at Textures/swanimals/Runyip/.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's current
  row(s) for this species, repointed from the bare "Runyip" entry in
  cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Runyip</defName>
    <label>runyip</label>
    <description>Runyip or Yavin Runyip were a species of squat quadrupeds from the moon Yavin 4. The creatures had antlered heads with a flexible nose. Their coats had a characteristic pattern of black or dark brown stripes on a whitish background. It is believed this striation made them a popular game animal for export to other worlds.</description>
